WEBVTT

01:43.360 --> 01:44.240
Jiang Li.

01:46.960 --> 01:47.960
Jiang Li,

01:49.000 --> 01:50.160
your letter is approved.

01:50.840 --> 01:52.920
See where Mr. Shen has assigned you.

01:54.880 --> 01:55.720
This time,

01:55.800 --> 01:57.920
the Court of State Ceremonial
categorized the reception.

01:58.000 --> 02:00.040
Liu Xu, Shijie, and I are

02:00.120 --> 02:01.480
with the Ministry of Rites,

02:01.560 --> 02:03.720
responsible for reception
along the way and the lodge.

02:03.800 --> 02:05.080
"Music Affairs Division"?

02:07.240 --> 02:08.240
Music Affairs Division?

02:10.199 --> 02:11.480
This isn't right.

02:12.040 --> 02:13.240
You play the guqin so well.

02:13.320 --> 02:14.880
Yet they make you play ordinary pieces

02:14.960 --> 02:16.280
with those musicians.

02:16.360 --> 02:17.880
What's going on here?

02:17.960 --> 02:19.840
Which part does Mr. Shen oversee?

02:19.920 --> 02:22.680
Of course Mr. Shen oversees everything.

02:23.320 --> 02:25.240
He and those
at the Hanlin Academy are responsible

02:25.320 --> 02:27.800
for compiling and organizing classics
for Great Zhao.

02:28.320 --> 02:30.720
This is the main focus
of the alliance meeting.

02:32.680 --> 02:34.560
Shen Yurong.

02:34.640 --> 02:36.280
You're so afraid that I'm so close to you.

02:36.920 --> 02:39.560
Are you afraid
I'll find something incriminating

02:39.640 --> 02:41.760
or that Wanning will go crazy
because of you

02:41.840 --> 02:44.000
and do something incriminating?

02:45.160 --> 02:46.880
It seems like you will be the first

02:47.840 --> 02:49.040
to slip up.

02:50.560 --> 02:51.840
- Yes.
- Of course.

02:51.920 --> 02:52.760
Seriously?

02:52.840 --> 02:59.840
BROADEN KNOWLEDGE WITH PROPRIETY

02:59.920 --> 03:01.880
Yes, we must finish this.

03:07.560 --> 03:09.800
Isn't she the Annual Exam top scorer
at the School of Integrity?

03:09.880 --> 03:11.360
What is she doing
at the Music Affairs Division?

03:11.440 --> 03:12.640
Shouldn't she be doing a solo?

03:13.120 --> 03:14.360
Ms. Jiang Li,

03:18.760 --> 03:21.200
you cannot touch this guqin.

03:27.760 --> 03:29.360
It belongs to Ms. Xiao.

03:32.160 --> 03:33.120
Where's mine?

03:33.200 --> 03:34.880
You're just like them, it's over there.

03:38.880 --> 03:40.000
I want to see Ms. Xiao.

03:40.520 --> 03:42.000
Who's looking for me?

03:55.080 --> 03:56.000
Ms. Xiao.

03:56.080 --> 03:57.960
I heard from Mr. Shen before

03:58.040 --> 03:59.720
that His Majesty wants
to hear me play solo.

03:59.800 --> 04:02.000
But I'm assigned to you.

04:02.080 --> 04:04.800
With this arrangement,

04:04.880 --> 04:06.800
isn't His Majesty's wish being ignored?

04:06.880 --> 04:08.320
Ms. Jiang Li,

04:08.400 --> 04:10.360
I know you won first place
in the Annual Exam

04:10.880 --> 04:14.200
and gained His Majesty's admiration,
so you are proud and confident.

04:14.760 --> 04:17.040
But look at these musicians
from the Music Office.

04:17.680 --> 04:20.000
They're all proud and confident too.

04:20.079 --> 04:22.000
If you don't show some real skill,

04:22.079 --> 04:24.000
you won't be able to convince them.

04:24.080 --> 04:26.080
Mr. Shen knows
your guqin skills are top-notch.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.640
That's why he wanted you to come

04:27.720 --> 04:29.600
and set an example for them.

04:29.680 --> 04:30.880
Ms. Jiang Li,

04:30.960 --> 04:33.240
could it be that you can't put aside
your noble status?

05:27.400 --> 05:29.240
We can't afford
to have a sham among the skilled

05:29.720 --> 05:31.240
in receiving the Great Zhao delegation.

05:31.320 --> 05:34.040
But Ms. Jiang Li has a special status,

05:34.120 --> 05:35.400
so she'll be excused this time.

05:36.440 --> 05:39.800
Today, I need everyone here to bear

05:40.640 --> 05:44.040
with Ms. Jiang Li until she catches up.

05:44.600 --> 05:47.200
These are the pieces you usually play.

05:48.880 --> 05:50.680
I just received the sheet music recently,

05:50.760 --> 05:53.480
so catching up
to everyone's level is challenging indeed.

05:53.560 --> 05:55.640
But I don't want to drag everyone down

05:56.240 --> 05:58.360
because I'm a Chancellor's daughter.

05:58.440 --> 05:59.880
Ms. Xiao,

05:59.960 --> 06:01.120
I'm willing to practice alone

06:01.200 --> 06:02.600
to catch up to everyone's level.

06:02.680 --> 06:05.400
In that case, do as you wish.

06:05.480 --> 06:06.840
You may practice alone.

06:26.080 --> 06:28.720
Ms. Jiang Li,
you need to practice diligently.

06:34.320 --> 06:35.800
If you fall behind,

06:35.880 --> 06:37.720
I can't afford

06:38.240 --> 06:39.520
to have Mr. Shen blame me.

06:39.600 --> 06:40.720
Ms. Xiao, don't worry.

06:40.800 --> 06:42.320
I won't let you down.

06:42.400 --> 06:43.440
Great.

07:23.400 --> 07:24.360
Help!

07:25.040 --> 07:26.920
I… I've been bitten.

07:28.600 --> 07:29.440
What happened?

07:30.880 --> 07:33.840
I found Jiuyue.

07:33.920 --> 07:34.920
Where is Jiuyue?

07:36.040 --> 07:38.040
I wanted to go to the snake cave
to catch snakes.

07:38.120 --> 07:40.160
He insisted on following me
and couldn't stop nagging.

07:41.440 --> 07:42.600
He ended up getting bitten by a snake.

07:44.800 --> 07:46.720
How dare you hit me?

07:48.560 --> 07:49.760
Where's the antidote?

07:50.520 --> 07:52.600
Trade your ten-year-old fine wine for it.

07:52.680 --> 07:53.520
Fine.

08:02.640 --> 08:05.120
Wen Ji said
you were looking for me urgently.

08:06.280 --> 08:07.880
Your brother is leading
the Great Zhao delegation

08:07.960 --> 08:09.040
and coming here
for an alliance meeting soon.

08:09.120 --> 08:10.440
You'll be reunited with him then.

08:11.520 --> 08:12.360
That's great news.

08:12.880 --> 08:15.320
Prince Cheng doesn't want us
to be friendly with Great Zhao.

08:16.080 --> 08:17.680
He'll definitely stop it from happening,

08:17.760 --> 08:19.160
which could endanger you.

08:19.240 --> 08:20.960
During this time,
stay at the Duke Mansion.

08:21.040 --> 08:21.880
You'll be safer here.

08:24.600 --> 08:28.000
Is that why you asked me to come?

08:28.840 --> 08:30.000
Are you that concerned about me?

08:30.080 --> 08:31.160
There's one more thing.

08:32.559 --> 08:33.400
What is it?

08:33.480 --> 08:34.520
Save two people.

08:34.600 --> 08:36.720
One has amnesia
and the other is disfigured by a knife.

08:36.799 --> 08:38.240
Xiao Heng.

08:39.280 --> 08:41.520
Do you see everyone

08:41.600 --> 08:42.679
as pawns?

08:42.760 --> 08:43.600
After it's done,

08:44.120 --> 08:46.400
you can have all the wine you want.

08:46.960 --> 08:47.920
Wine?

08:49.520 --> 08:51.080
That's two lives we're talking about.

08:53.040 --> 08:54.520
How can that be enough?

08:54.600 --> 08:55.600
What do you propose then?

08:56.240 --> 08:57.080
Tell me.

08:57.160 --> 09:00.200
For whose sake
do you want to save those two?

09:03.560 --> 09:04.760
You're struggling to answer.

09:05.760 --> 09:09.280
Is it for Ms. Jiang Li again?

09:09.840 --> 09:12.320
Will you save them or not?

09:14.560 --> 09:16.120
Is this how you ask for help?

09:16.200 --> 09:17.440
What do you want me to do?

09:19.200 --> 09:20.120
I want you

09:21.200 --> 09:22.480
to accompany me to catch spiders.

09:22.560 --> 09:25.240
Show me your sincerity.

09:40.360 --> 09:41.760
I thought you wanted to catch spiders.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.760
- Are we catching them here?
- Yes.

09:46.040 --> 09:47.440
I'm not here to swim with you.

09:49.040 --> 09:51.480
To catch water spiders,
we have to catch them from the water.

09:53.000 --> 09:53.960
Wait here.

09:56.680 --> 09:57.560
Keep an eye on her.

09:58.120 --> 09:58.960
Yes.

10:06.240 --> 10:07.280
Why are you back?

10:07.360 --> 10:09.160
While undressing, she was saying

10:09.240 --> 10:10.320
that if I stay,

10:10.400 --> 10:12.520
she'll tell Great Zhao's emperor
that she was molested.

10:33.560 --> 10:34.400
Xiao Heng!

10:39.280 --> 10:41.640
It turns out you truly care about me.

10:41.720 --> 10:44.160
If you don't want to save them,
you don't have to toy with me like this.

10:44.240 --> 10:45.080
I…

10:52.880 --> 10:53.720
Xiao Heng,

10:54.280 --> 10:55.560
haven't you toyed with me before?

11:09.800 --> 11:11.320
The arrow is poisoned.

11:11.400 --> 11:12.520
Only I can cure it.

11:15.760 --> 11:17.240
If you want me to save you,

11:18.440 --> 11:21.360
you have to offer yourself to me.

11:22.600 --> 11:23.920
I don't do romance.

11:25.280 --> 11:26.440
It's up to you to save me or not.

11:29.440 --> 11:30.640
Is your refusal to indulge in romance

11:32.120 --> 11:33.520
only meant for me?

11:33.600 --> 11:35.480
So you're not going
to save those two people then.

11:38.160 --> 11:39.520
I can save them

11:40.120 --> 11:43.520
as long as you offer your life in return.

11:43.600 --> 11:45.040
Jiuyue, stop messing around.

11:45.600 --> 11:46.520
Fine,

11:47.720 --> 11:48.880
I'll stop.

11:50.520 --> 11:51.920
As for those two,

11:52.000 --> 11:53.440
I can save them or not.

11:55.720 --> 11:56.560
Jiuyue.

11:58.800 --> 11:59.640
Lu Ji,

12:00.240 --> 12:01.160
keep her safe.

12:01.240 --> 12:02.080
Yes.

12:11.920 --> 12:12.760
HANLIN ACADEMY

12:12.840 --> 12:13.680
Mr. Shen,

12:13.760 --> 12:17.000
this is the budget for meals
from the Court of State Ceremonial.

12:17.080 --> 12:18.000
Please review it.

12:18.080 --> 12:19.040
BANQUET EXPENSES OVERVIEW

12:19.120 --> 12:21.680
Mr. Shen, this is the repertoire
of the Music Affairs Division.

12:21.760 --> 12:22.840
Please review this too.

12:24.680 --> 12:25.880
Thank you.

12:26.600 --> 12:28.640
The alliance meeting with Great Zhao
is of great significance.

12:28.720 --> 12:31.240
I'll need more help from both of you.

12:31.320 --> 12:34.440
Please inform me promptly of any issues.

12:34.520 --> 12:35.360
Yes.

12:39.200 --> 12:41.800
Ms. Xiao, do you have something to say?

12:41.880 --> 12:44.680
It's nothing urgent.

12:44.760 --> 12:46.160
It's just that Ms. Jiang Li

12:46.640 --> 12:48.600
has been absent from rehearsals
for two days.

12:49.440 --> 12:52.040
She said she was not well
and might need more days of rest.

12:52.600 --> 12:54.200
Resting is understandable.

12:54.280 --> 12:57.520
But she's unfamiliar
with the new repertoire.

12:57.600 --> 12:59.160
If we wait for her to recover,

12:59.760 --> 13:03.040
she might hold back
the Music Affairs Division's performance.

13:03.120 --> 13:04.600
If her health can't handle it,

13:05.200 --> 13:06.920
it's better for her to get proper rest.

13:35.560 --> 13:36.960
Shijie, why are you here?

13:37.480 --> 13:39.200
Xiao Deyin said you're not well,

13:39.280 --> 13:40.640
so I brought medicine for you.

13:41.200 --> 13:42.280
Thank you, Shijie.

13:47.840 --> 13:49.480
But how did you get sick

13:49.560 --> 13:51.240
just from practicing the guqin?

13:51.320 --> 13:52.160
Shijie,

13:52.920 --> 13:54.880
I remember you mentioned before

13:54.960 --> 13:58.160
that His Majesty wanted to hear me play
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms."

13:58.240 --> 13:59.280
That's correct.

13:59.360 --> 14:03.280
But why did Mr. Shen place me
in the Music Affairs Division?

14:03.360 --> 14:06.000
He said he hoped you'd inspire
the Music Affairs Division to work harder.

14:06.080 --> 14:09.360
But following Mr. Shen's instructions,
Ms. Xiao gave me new sheet music.

14:10.920 --> 14:12.640
Instead of highlighting my strengths,

14:13.120 --> 14:14.600
it exposed my weaknesses.

14:14.680 --> 14:17.160
It's my fault for being too busy lately
that I overlooked you.

14:17.760 --> 14:19.240
I'll go and see Mr. Shen shortly.

14:19.800 --> 14:21.680
I really don't want to stay
in the Music Affairs Division.

14:22.240 --> 14:24.320
If you do want to help me,

14:25.240 --> 14:26.520
I have a solution.

14:36.760 --> 14:37.720
HONGXIAO GRAND CEREMONY

14:40.440 --> 14:43.240
Your thorough arrangement puts my mind
at ease, Minister Shen.

14:43.320 --> 14:44.280
There's something

14:44.760 --> 14:46.280
I shouldn't trouble Your Majesty with.

14:46.360 --> 14:48.280
But it concerns Jiang Li,
the Chief Secretariat's daughter,

14:48.360 --> 14:50.320
so I dare not make decisions on my own.

14:51.440 --> 14:52.280
Go on.

14:52.360 --> 14:54.680
Your Majesty wants Ms. Jiang Li
to represent Great Yan

14:54.760 --> 14:55.960
and showcase her guqin skills.

14:56.040 --> 14:57.760
But the alliance meeting
isn't like the Annual Exam.

14:57.840 --> 15:00.280
Her performance in the latter
would only affect herself.

15:00.760 --> 15:03.680
It has been several months
since the Annual exam,

15:03.760 --> 15:05.200
and many things happened after that,

15:05.280 --> 15:06.920
making her guqin skills unavoidably rusty.

15:07.000 --> 15:09.840
I initially thought of letting her
practice at the Music Affairs Division.

15:09.920 --> 15:10.960
But she fell ill unexpectedly.

15:11.440 --> 15:13.080
Forcing her

15:13.160 --> 15:14.720
might not only be detrimental
to the alliance meeting,

15:14.800 --> 15:17.480
but also make the Chief Secretariat feel
that my arrangements aren't good.

15:17.560 --> 15:19.760
Minister Shen, what do you suggest then?

15:19.840 --> 15:22.000
Let Ms. Jiang Li focus on recovering.

15:22.080 --> 15:24.440
Your Majesty, Mr. Shen.

15:25.240 --> 15:27.160
Upon hearing that my cousin was sick,
I went to visit her.

15:27.240 --> 15:29.800
Ms. Xiao gave Jiang Li a music piece
that the musicians know well,

15:29.880 --> 15:32.120
but was unfamiliar to her.

15:32.200 --> 15:35.000
Jiang Li practiced day and night
to not burden the Music Affairs Division

15:35.080 --> 15:35.920
and fell ill.

15:36.000 --> 15:38.040
She continued practicing in spite of that,

15:38.120 --> 15:40.160
showing her dedication.

15:40.240 --> 15:41.600
The alliance meeting is important.

15:41.680 --> 15:43.120
Given Jiang Li's current condition,

15:43.200 --> 15:44.360
even if she doesn't practice new pieces

15:44.440 --> 15:46.840
and only plays
"Spring Fading into White Pear Blossoms",

15:46.920 --> 15:49.920
she might not be as good as she was
at the Annual Exam even if she recovers.

15:50.000 --> 15:51.280
Your Majesty, please consider this.

15:52.000 --> 15:54.760
Jiang Li just needs a few days of rest
to recover from her illness.

15:54.840 --> 15:56.840
She may not be
as good as she was in the Annual Exam,

15:56.920 --> 15:58.640
but Jiang Li is talented and devoted.

15:59.160 --> 16:01.080
If we don't stick
to the Annual Exam repertoire,

16:01.160 --> 16:04.200
perhaps she could recite poems
and play the guqin with Hanlin scholars

16:04.280 --> 16:05.680
to create a new performance style,

16:05.760 --> 16:07.680
highlighting each other's strengths
and covering weaknesses,

16:07.760 --> 16:11.160
which could be refreshing
to the Zhao delegation.

16:11.240 --> 16:12.200
How is that appropriate?

16:12.280 --> 16:13.640
Minister Shen, calm down.

16:14.280 --> 16:16.360
Minister Ye's proposal is intriguing.

16:17.360 --> 16:20.840
Innovating has always been your forte.

16:20.920 --> 16:22.800
Minister Shen,
you might as well give it a try.

16:24.680 --> 16:25.640
- Yes.
- Yes.

16:42.240 --> 16:43.560
Your pawn

16:43.640 --> 16:45.600
always involves me
like this unnecessarily.

16:45.680 --> 16:46.920
That's her talent.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.080
So tell me,

16:49.160 --> 16:50.560
what does she ultimately want to do?

16:50.640 --> 16:52.040
Perhaps Your Majesty should ask

16:52.120 --> 16:53.240
Ms. Jiang Li?

16:54.640 --> 16:57.760
I guess there are still things
that even you can't figure out.

16:59.040 --> 17:00.000
Interesting.

17:02.160 --> 17:08.960
HANLIN ACADEMY

17:15.480 --> 17:17.280
Isn't this Ms. Jiang Li?

17:19.760 --> 17:21.160
Are you here at the Hanlin Academy

17:21.240 --> 17:23.240
to catch the eye
of some young master again?

17:23.319 --> 17:24.880
I've told you before.

17:24.960 --> 17:27.200
If you miss out on me,
you won't find anyone better.

17:27.280 --> 17:28.680
Your outfit today looks nice.

17:29.360 --> 17:31.120
Did you have a blind date
with someone inside?

17:31.200 --> 17:34.440
I… I'm here at the Hanlin Academy
to participate in compiling the classics.

17:34.520 --> 17:35.960
As for you,

17:36.040 --> 17:37.120
what are you doing here?

17:37.200 --> 17:38.560
Mr. Shen summoned me.

17:38.640 --> 17:40.040
Mr. Shen?

17:41.200 --> 17:42.920
You two just made a scene
in front of His Majesty

17:43.000 --> 17:44.080
and you still dare to interact?

17:44.160 --> 17:45.520
Aren't you afraid of gossip?

17:47.280 --> 17:49.320
A clear conscience fears no slander.

17:49.400 --> 17:50.560
Impressive.

17:59.040 --> 18:00.880
Why did you ask me to come, Mr. Shen?

18:00.960 --> 18:02.440
Didn't your cousin tell you?

18:02.520 --> 18:04.600
Since you're in charge of this matter,

18:04.680 --> 18:06.200
it only counts if it comes from you.

18:06.280 --> 18:08.560
His Majesty
has approved Ye Shijie's proposal.

18:09.240 --> 18:10.640
Who would you like to perform with

18:11.760 --> 18:13.240
at the Hanlin Academy?

18:15.480 --> 18:17.280
Naturally, you…

18:18.000 --> 18:19.120
have the final say.

18:21.840 --> 18:22.840
In that case,

18:23.760 --> 18:24.920
do it with Zhao Qi.

18:25.000 --> 18:26.840
You seemed quite close just now.

18:26.920 --> 18:29.000
It saves time in getting acquainted.

18:29.080 --> 18:30.280
Can you choose someone else?

18:30.360 --> 18:31.960
Didn't you say I have the final say?

18:32.040 --> 18:33.480
Since you insist,

18:34.280 --> 18:35.520
I'll follow your arrangement.

18:36.280 --> 18:38.960
I'll go talk to Zhao Qi
and start rehearsals tomorrow.

18:48.560 --> 18:49.400
Baixue,

18:50.200 --> 18:51.440
I remember my cousin, Jia'er,

18:51.520 --> 18:53.200
gave me some silk and satin before.

18:54.200 --> 18:56.560
There was a handwoven
cloud brocade handkerchief.

18:57.040 --> 18:58.200
Bring it to me later.

18:58.960 --> 19:01.440
My lady, you should have used it earlier.

19:01.520 --> 19:02.640
Such good material

19:02.720 --> 19:04.440
should match a beautiful woman like you.

19:05.600 --> 19:07.360
It's not for my personal use.

19:07.440 --> 19:08.680
Then what is it for?

19:08.760 --> 19:10.000
To please others.

19:16.560 --> 19:18.520
I was actually looking forward
to your performance.

19:18.600 --> 19:19.760
Now,

19:19.840 --> 19:21.520
I've become a part of this show.

19:22.360 --> 19:24.080
I know you don't want to perform with me.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.800
Neither do I.

19:26.320 --> 19:29.200
So go talk to Mr. Shen and decline it.

19:29.280 --> 19:30.600
Me?

19:30.680 --> 19:32.360
- Yes.
- Forget it.

19:32.440 --> 19:33.920
If I offend Mr. Shen,

19:34.000 --> 19:35.960
can I still stay at Hanlin Academy?

19:36.040 --> 19:37.200
Besides,

19:37.280 --> 19:39.880
this is also an opportunity
to impress His Majesty.

19:39.960 --> 19:41.120
Why would I decline it?

19:41.200 --> 19:42.080
You must go.

19:43.120 --> 19:47.280
Otherwise, your parents will find out
about the lady you're keeping--

19:48.240 --> 19:49.640
- Are you going or not?
- Is that a threat?

19:49.720 --> 19:52.080
I'm not just threatening you.
There's also a bribe.

19:52.760 --> 19:55.480
I heard you've been searching
for this cloud brocade handkerchief.

19:55.560 --> 19:57.360
Today, I brought you a top-notch one.

19:57.920 --> 19:58.960
Take a look.

19:59.040 --> 20:00.920
Will it catch the eye of your sweetheart?

20:04.400 --> 20:05.280
Let me take a look.

20:10.760 --> 20:12.840
This cloud brocade handkerchief
is from Luyang.

20:13.320 --> 20:14.960
It's hard to find in the capital.

20:15.040 --> 20:16.160
How…

20:16.240 --> 20:17.880
How did you get it?

20:17.960 --> 20:19.720
My maternal grandmother's family
is from Luyang.

20:25.000 --> 20:25.840
Then

20:26.360 --> 20:28.400
I'll reluctantly cooperate

20:29.240 --> 20:30.080
with you.

20:39.240 --> 20:41.840
Please replace me with someone else
for Ms. Jiang Li.

20:42.720 --> 20:44.120
We discussed marriage before.

20:44.200 --> 20:45.600
If we perform together,

20:45.680 --> 20:46.920
it'll inevitably draw criticism.

20:47.000 --> 20:48.440
If you have a clear conscience,

20:48.520 --> 20:49.960
why care about what others think?

20:51.320 --> 20:52.840
Even though I have a clear conscience,

20:54.120 --> 20:55.840
gossip is a fearful thing.

20:56.760 --> 20:58.240
It's a tribute to Great Zhao.

20:58.880 --> 21:01.960
I hope you can set aside personal emotions
and prioritize the bigger picture.

21:02.520 --> 21:03.360
Mr. Shen.

21:04.440 --> 21:05.280
Mr. Shen--

21:15.320 --> 21:16.520
We don't have much time left.

21:16.600 --> 21:17.720
Let's go inside and rehearse.

21:26.560 --> 21:29.520
HANLIN ACADEMY

21:42.880 --> 21:43.720
Yurong,

21:44.600 --> 21:46.640
they're not even rehearsing.

21:47.360 --> 21:48.760
What are they doing inside?

21:53.080 --> 21:54.680
I tried to persuade him to replace me.

21:54.760 --> 21:55.920
But he wouldn't listen.

21:57.560 --> 21:59.240
Put on another act for me.

22:00.320 --> 22:02.480
What? Again?

22:02.560 --> 22:05.440
Does your sweetheart
like that handkerchief?

22:06.520 --> 22:08.480
I have even better ones.

22:08.560 --> 22:11.040
I'll bring them tomorrow.
You can let her choose.

22:12.880 --> 22:14.440
Just this once, I won't do it again.

22:14.520 --> 22:15.520
All right.

22:16.520 --> 22:17.360
Go home.

22:17.840 --> 22:18.680
All right.

22:20.320 --> 22:21.200
Jiang Li,

22:21.280 --> 22:22.760
are you doing this on purpose?

22:22.840 --> 22:23.760
All along,

22:23.840 --> 22:25.160
you must have planned this.

22:25.240 --> 22:26.400
I planned this?

22:26.480 --> 22:27.720
What scheme could I have?

22:27.800 --> 22:29.680
It was Mr. Shen who asked me to come.

22:30.320 --> 22:32.120
How would I know he wanted me
to work with you?

22:32.200 --> 22:33.480
You don't know?

22:33.560 --> 22:35.440
Stop pretending already.

22:35.520 --> 22:37.000
I made it clear to you before.

22:37.080 --> 22:38.360
We're not suitable.

22:38.440 --> 22:39.920
Now, you're throwing yourself at me,

22:40.000 --> 22:41.800
people might think
we're getting back together.

22:41.880 --> 22:43.760
How can I get married in the future?

22:43.840 --> 22:45.960
Do you think
you're the only one who minds?

22:46.040 --> 22:47.760
There's nothing we can do now.

22:47.840 --> 22:49.120
I don't have anything to say to you.

22:49.200 --> 22:50.520
That makes the two of us.

23:06.080 --> 23:07.880
Mr. Shen, I apologize for that.

23:14.280 --> 23:15.120
Go home first.

23:16.280 --> 23:17.120
Yurong.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.320
I said, go.

23:36.480 --> 23:37.320
Ms. Jiang Li,

23:41.320 --> 23:42.280
what happened here?

23:42.840 --> 23:44.520
Weren't you two rehearsing
just fine earlier?

23:44.600 --> 23:48.120
- Did you do this on purpose, Mr. Shen?
- I did this on purpose?

23:48.200 --> 23:50.960
I overheard the conversation
between you and Zhao Qi this afternoon.

23:51.040 --> 23:53.040
It seemed like
you deliberately brought someone

23:53.120 --> 23:54.640
who discussed marriage with me

23:54.720 --> 23:57.480
to stir up trouble and make me pull out.

23:57.560 --> 23:59.400
Ms. Jiang Li, you're mistaken.

23:59.480 --> 24:02.480
Zhao Qi is a highly talented man
among the Hanlin scholars.

24:03.000 --> 24:04.360
If I didn't do this,

24:04.440 --> 24:06.680
I would have let down
your deliberate suggestion

24:08.080 --> 24:10.920
to have Minister Ye propose ideas
in front of His Majesty.

24:14.040 --> 24:15.160
Mr. Shen, mind your words.

24:15.240 --> 24:18.120
You were the one who tried to get rid
of me in front of His Majesty first.

24:18.200 --> 24:19.680
You were absent due to illness first.

24:19.760 --> 24:22.160
I don't know
how I ever offended you, Mr. Shen.

24:22.240 --> 24:23.520
You've been suspicious of me

24:23.600 --> 24:25.240
and targeting me all along.

24:25.840 --> 24:27.280
Helping with the alliance meeting

24:27.360 --> 24:28.760
would bring honor to Great Yan

24:28.840 --> 24:30.320
and add glory to the Jiang family.

24:31.040 --> 24:32.600
So I won't give up.

24:33.360 --> 24:35.160
If you continue
making things difficult for me,

24:35.240 --> 24:37.600
it will reflect poorly on Great Yan.

24:43.960 --> 24:44.800
Tomorrow,

24:47.520 --> 24:49.080
I'll find another person for you.

25:03.120 --> 25:03.960
Mr. Zhao.

25:04.040 --> 25:05.040
Mr. Du.

25:05.120 --> 25:07.440
- Can we talk?
- What's the matter?

25:08.040 --> 25:10.480
Mr. Shen assigned me to rehearse a program

25:10.560 --> 25:11.480
with Ms. Jiang Li.

25:11.560 --> 25:12.760
Congratulations, Mr. Du.

25:13.240 --> 25:14.880
When you shine brightly
in the alliance meeting

25:14.960 --> 25:15.840
and please His Majesty,

25:15.920 --> 25:18.240
it will be beneficial for your career.

25:18.320 --> 25:20.240
It looks good on the surface.

25:20.800 --> 25:24.080
However, why did you
decline it with Mr. Shen?

25:30.680 --> 25:32.760
I'm telling you this
because you're my friend.

25:33.760 --> 25:36.120
What seems good on the surface

25:37.040 --> 25:40.440
often hides underlying tensions.

25:41.000 --> 25:41.840
How so?

25:43.280 --> 25:44.240
Let me put it this way.

25:44.320 --> 25:45.760
Jiang Li is really evil.

25:45.840 --> 25:47.120
She really eats people.

25:48.360 --> 25:49.720
What? She really eats people?

25:49.800 --> 25:51.080
It was just a metaphor.

25:51.600 --> 25:53.000
I just want to let you know

25:53.080 --> 25:55.440
that sometimes
something appears to be a blessing,

25:55.520 --> 25:59.400
but it's actually
a bottomless abyss underneath.

25:59.480 --> 26:01.000
What should I do then?

26:01.080 --> 26:03.680
Jiang Li is coming to rehearse
with me tonight.

26:04.680 --> 26:05.520
Mr. Zhao,

26:05.600 --> 26:07.680
could you give me some advice?

26:07.760 --> 26:09.440
Mr. Shen is kind.

26:09.520 --> 26:11.600
He understood my difficulty
and changed his decision.

26:11.680 --> 26:14.080
If you have difficulties too,

26:14.160 --> 26:16.000
there's bound to be someone
with no difficulties

26:16.080 --> 26:17.600
among so many scholars in Hanlin.

26:23.320 --> 26:24.680
I understand it now.

26:24.760 --> 26:25.880
Thank you, Mr. Zhao.

26:34.520 --> 26:35.360
Go

26:36.000 --> 26:38.560
and ask Jiang Li
for the pearl necklace she promised.

26:38.640 --> 26:39.600
Yes.

26:39.680 --> 26:42.400
RESPECT THE TRUTH

26:47.320 --> 26:49.080
- Mr. Cheng, please come this way.
- All right.

26:49.760 --> 26:52.320
- Leave these here.
- Then I'll go and see them tomorrow.

26:52.400 --> 26:53.640
- I'll get going.
- I'll go with you.

26:53.720 --> 26:55.480
- All right.
- Liu, take care.

26:55.560 --> 26:56.480
Let's go.

27:08.520 --> 27:09.600
What's wrong?

27:09.680 --> 27:12.040
I craved cold drinks last night
and mixed ice cubes in water.

27:12.120 --> 27:14.160
Now, my stomach hurts terribly.

27:14.240 --> 27:15.920
Come on, I'll take you to the physician.

27:16.000 --> 27:17.040
No.

27:17.640 --> 27:18.760
I couldn't hold it earlier.

27:19.760 --> 27:20.840
I've already…

27:23.360 --> 27:24.400
soiled my trousers.

27:27.040 --> 27:28.400
You…

27:28.480 --> 27:29.480
Mr. Shen,

27:29.560 --> 27:31.640
I'll go home first to wash up
and change my clothes.

27:31.720 --> 27:33.160
Then I'll see a physician.

27:33.240 --> 27:35.320
I might not be able
to attend tonight's rehearsal.

27:35.400 --> 27:37.480
I hope you can keep this a secret

27:37.560 --> 27:38.960
and protect my reputation.

27:39.040 --> 27:40.200
I'll take my leave now.

27:46.640 --> 27:48.680
HANLIN ACADEMY

28:12.280 --> 28:13.240
Ms. Jiang Li,

28:14.040 --> 28:14.880
why do you…

28:14.960 --> 28:16.600
My carriage broke down on the way.

28:17.320 --> 28:19.080
I had to walk over, so I'm late.

28:19.760 --> 28:20.760
I can begin now.

28:21.400 --> 28:22.880
I found Mr. Du, a talented scholar

28:22.960 --> 28:25.280
among the Hanli students,
to perform with you.

28:25.360 --> 28:26.600
Unfortunately,

28:26.680 --> 28:27.640
- he--
- It's fine.

28:28.480 --> 28:31.840
I know no one wants to perform with me.

28:35.320 --> 28:37.800
I'm all soaked, but end up with nothing.

28:38.520 --> 28:40.080
Mr. Shen, I must look foolish.

28:42.040 --> 28:42.920
Jiang Li,

28:43.680 --> 28:45.600
everything I said earlier was true.

28:45.680 --> 28:47.400
I had no intention
of playing tricks on you.

28:48.520 --> 28:50.320
He really isn't feeling well today.

28:53.080 --> 28:54.680
I'm not blaming you.

28:55.200 --> 28:56.680
I'm blaming myself.

28:59.520 --> 29:00.680
For so many years,

29:00.760 --> 29:02.640
I've carried the stigma
of matricide and fratricide.

29:02.720 --> 29:04.360
The Eldest Princess
questioned my identity,

29:04.960 --> 29:06.800
my mother went mad,
and my father is away from home.

29:07.360 --> 29:09.560
It's no wonder you avoided me before this.

29:09.640 --> 29:10.520
At this alliance meeting,

29:10.600 --> 29:12.680
I just wanted to make a name for myself.

29:12.760 --> 29:13.880
I didn't expect

29:14.600 --> 29:15.840
that all of you

29:16.360 --> 29:18.440
already see me as a jinx.

29:19.000 --> 29:19.960
Take shelter here first.

29:20.960 --> 29:22.240
Leave when the rain stops.

29:30.040 --> 29:32.360
Put this on for now.
You can leave when the rain lets up.

29:40.160 --> 29:42.400
This is Garden of Eloquence
by Liu Xiang from the Han Dynasty.

29:43.000 --> 29:43.840
Exactly.

29:45.520 --> 29:48.760
Dear, you should include
Garden of Eloquence in the compilation.

29:49.840 --> 29:51.080
My father mentioned

29:51.160 --> 29:52.720
he was very interested
in Garden of Eloquence.

29:52.800 --> 29:55.320
But most of it has been lost now.

29:55.400 --> 29:58.680
He said if someone could collect
and recompile it,

29:58.760 --> 29:59.920
it would be a great merit.

30:02.360 --> 30:04.960
GARDEN OF ELOQUENCE

30:05.840 --> 30:08.440
I remember it has 20 volumes,

30:08.520 --> 30:10.320
but most of them are lost.

30:10.880 --> 30:13.200
I didn't expect you to collect so much.

30:13.280 --> 30:14.760
It took me quite an effort

30:15.360 --> 30:16.800
to gather these fragments.

30:16.880 --> 30:19.000
That's why I plan
to compile them into a book.

30:19.080 --> 30:21.520
This way, this classic
can be passed down through generations

30:22.000 --> 30:23.080
and benefit future generations.

30:26.080 --> 30:27.360
Mr. Shen, you're really amazing.

30:28.120 --> 30:29.520
Ms. Jiang Li, you're too kind.

30:30.840 --> 30:31.720
But you

30:31.800 --> 30:33.600
were able to recognize Garden of Eloquence

30:33.680 --> 30:35.240
with just these fragments.

30:36.040 --> 30:37.600
That's quite surprising.

30:39.280 --> 30:41.520
Mr. Shen, you're different
from what I imagined.

30:41.600 --> 30:43.040
How so?

30:43.120 --> 30:44.240
I thought

30:44.320 --> 30:47.640
those favored by His Majesty
would be skilled in social interactions.

30:47.720 --> 30:50.200
I didn't expect you
to rely on your knowledge.

30:50.280 --> 30:51.720
You truly have remarkable qualities.

30:51.800 --> 30:54.040
I'm just following the principles
in the book.

30:54.120 --> 30:56.800
An official should follow
the six righteous paths.

30:57.680 --> 31:00.400
Being humble and diligent,
progressing daily in virtue,

31:00.480 --> 31:03.440
recommending the virtuous and talented
tirelessly and upholding the law.

31:03.520 --> 31:06.600
The book says there are six righteous
and six unrighteous paths.

31:07.360 --> 31:09.920
Following righteous paths brings honor,
while the other disgrace.

31:10.000 --> 31:13.200
A virtuous official follows
the righteous paths and avoids the other,

31:13.280 --> 31:15.080
thus ensuring stability
and good governance.

31:18.440 --> 31:19.960
Mr. Shen,

31:20.040 --> 31:23.680
if a person acts righteously
but also commits unrighteous acts,

31:23.760 --> 31:26.800
is this person still righteous or not?

31:28.840 --> 31:31.040
All things follow the laws
of heaven and earth.

31:31.120 --> 31:32.600
If one goes against their conscience,

31:33.200 --> 31:34.680
no matter how many good deeds they do,

31:36.480 --> 31:38.120
they will face divine retribution.

31:50.000 --> 31:51.480
I believe

31:51.560 --> 31:53.800
you're a person who acts uprightly.

31:53.880 --> 31:56.880
Ms. Jiang Li, the rain has stopped.

32:03.080 --> 32:04.120
I'll take my leave.

32:05.040 --> 32:06.200
Thank you

32:06.280 --> 32:08.040
for not minding talking with me.

32:08.680 --> 32:09.960
I'll take my leave now.

32:17.800 --> 32:20.840
I'll return your clothes
after washing them.

33:02.240 --> 33:06.720
HANLIN ACADEMY

33:19.240 --> 33:21.360
What gross encounter did you have

33:21.440 --> 33:22.680
to torture yourself like this?

33:26.480 --> 33:27.640
Duke Su,

33:27.720 --> 33:29.000
why are you here?

33:30.760 --> 33:31.840
Your clothes

33:32.720 --> 33:33.560
look terrible.

33:34.240 --> 33:35.520
Come with me.

33:53.600 --> 33:57.320
HANLIN ACADEMY

34:15.320 --> 34:16.360
Does it fit?

34:17.520 --> 34:20.560
Why don't you have women's clothes
at your place?

34:20.639 --> 34:22.360
You already know my background.

34:22.840 --> 34:23.840
Don't you know why?

34:23.920 --> 34:25.520
They say you don't like women.

34:27.520 --> 34:28.360
But why?

34:29.360 --> 34:30.600
Women are wonderful.

34:30.679 --> 34:31.880
They're caring

34:32.520 --> 34:33.360
and considerate.

34:33.440 --> 34:34.320
What about you?

34:36.159 --> 34:37.719
You're not getting any younger.

34:37.800 --> 34:39.280
You're the one who's getting older.

34:39.360 --> 34:41.239
I actually feel quite good

34:41.320 --> 34:42.800
living alone these days.

34:45.199 --> 34:47.000
No emotions to worry about

34:47.080 --> 34:48.120
and free to act.

34:48.199 --> 34:50.239
You're the one
who truly fits that description.

34:50.840 --> 34:51.840
Thanks for the compliment.

34:54.760 --> 34:56.639
But there's something
I need to remind you of.

34:56.719 --> 34:59.680
Getting close to Shen Yurong
is a risky move.

34:59.760 --> 35:00.960
I have to do it.

35:01.560 --> 35:02.720
I want to face him

35:03.320 --> 35:05.240
just like he faced Xue Fangfei
in her grave.

35:05.320 --> 35:06.840
I need to find his weakness

35:06.920 --> 35:08.800
to clear Xue Fangfei's name.

35:08.880 --> 35:10.000
What weakness?

35:10.080 --> 35:11.200
I haven't found it yet.

35:11.280 --> 35:13.320
Over time, he will eventually slip up.

35:17.280 --> 35:18.880
Have you considered the consequences?

35:18.960 --> 35:19.880
Xiao Heng,

35:20.440 --> 35:21.760
you can be more frank.

35:22.880 --> 35:25.960
Eldest Princess' retaliation
could cost me my life.

35:26.520 --> 35:27.840
And my all-or-nothing gamble

35:29.000 --> 35:30.840
might also be a path
to my own destruction.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.640
Admitting it

35:32.720 --> 35:33.880
means you're afraid.

35:34.640 --> 35:37.040
Having fear is a good thing.

35:37.120 --> 35:40.600
I actually feel quite relieved

35:41.560 --> 35:42.840
after saying it out loud to you.

35:43.400 --> 35:44.960
Do I also have a therapeutic effect?

35:45.040 --> 35:46.520
Anyway, I have nothing to lose.

35:48.760 --> 35:49.640
Have some chicken.

35:55.440 --> 35:56.640
Has Jiuyue returned?

35:56.720 --> 35:58.040
She was here. But she left.

35:58.520 --> 36:00.560
Don't worry about Magistrate Xue
and that young lady.

36:00.640 --> 36:01.800
I remember them.

36:01.880 --> 36:04.160
But you know what she's like.

36:04.240 --> 36:05.320
She is too willful.

36:05.400 --> 36:06.720
I'm sorry to trouble you.

36:06.800 --> 36:08.120
You have to promise me one thing.

36:10.160 --> 36:11.840
No matter what plans
you make in the future,

36:12.760 --> 36:14.880
don't get yourself caught up in them.

36:17.120 --> 36:18.240
You have nothing to lose.

36:21.040 --> 36:22.640
But it may not be the same for me.

36:27.520 --> 36:28.520
All right.

36:35.440 --> 36:36.360
It's burned.

36:42.440 --> 36:43.960
Yurong, where were you?

36:45.240 --> 36:46.480
At the Hanlin Academy.

36:46.960 --> 36:49.120
Compiling the classics
has been very hectic these days.

36:49.200 --> 36:50.480
Stop pretending.

36:51.640 --> 36:53.640
Your sister told me everything
when she got back.

36:55.720 --> 36:56.560
Tonight,

36:57.480 --> 36:59.600
were you with Jiang Li?

37:02.640 --> 37:03.480
No.

37:04.120 --> 37:06.520
You still don't understand
the seriousness of this matter.

37:06.600 --> 37:09.200
Have you forgotten
the suffering our family went through?

37:09.840 --> 37:10.800
Father,

37:10.880 --> 37:12.600
I will avenge you.

37:12.680 --> 37:16.080
After taking revenge
on this corrupt official,

37:16.160 --> 37:20.840
there will be others who would oppress us.

37:22.880 --> 37:26.480
Unless you become an official,

37:27.040 --> 37:30.280
not only will you fail to take revenge,

37:30.360 --> 37:35.880
but you'll also bring trouble
to our family.

37:36.640 --> 37:37.520
Don't worry.

37:37.600 --> 37:39.160
I will study hard

37:39.680 --> 37:40.680
and become a top scorer.

37:41.160 --> 37:43.760
Then I'll be a good official

37:43.840 --> 37:46.120
and eradicate all corrupt ones
who mistreat the people!

37:47.040 --> 37:48.000
Have you forgotten

37:48.080 --> 37:50.040
your promise to your father
on his deathbed?

37:50.600 --> 37:52.920
How difficult was it
to get to where you are now?

37:54.160 --> 37:55.000
What do you think

37:56.560 --> 38:00.200
Her Highness would feel if she found out

38:00.960 --> 38:04.160
you were associating with Ms. Jiang Li,

38:04.240 --> 38:05.280
who looks like Xue Fangfei?

38:06.240 --> 38:07.360
They are not the same person.

38:08.040 --> 38:09.520
Mother, stop mixing them up.

38:09.600 --> 38:11.280
Is that the point?

38:11.360 --> 38:12.880
Does my opinion matter?

38:12.960 --> 38:16.400
The point is Her Highness believes
she's Xue Fangfei.

38:16.960 --> 38:18.480
Think about your grand ambitions.

38:18.560 --> 38:20.280
Think about how our family

38:20.360 --> 38:21.600
got our good life now.

38:21.680 --> 38:22.560
Yurong,

38:22.640 --> 38:24.720
do not play with fire.

38:24.800 --> 38:26.320
Mother, you don't need to remind me.

38:26.400 --> 38:27.360
I know the path

38:28.080 --> 38:29.280
I must take better than anyone.

38:42.520 --> 38:43.560
My lord,

38:43.640 --> 38:44.760
you won't believe it.

38:45.360 --> 38:47.200
Being poisoned

38:47.280 --> 38:48.480
felt quite fascinating.

38:49.200 --> 38:52.640
I saw so many beautiful women around me.

38:53.200 --> 38:55.960
I just hugged them all.

38:56.040 --> 38:56.880
Then I…

38:58.680 --> 39:00.720
Then let Jiuyue catch another snake
to bite you again.

39:00.800 --> 39:01.640
Don't.

39:01.720 --> 39:03.320
I was just joking.

39:16.520 --> 39:17.760
Is she drunk?

39:17.840 --> 39:19.160
How much did she drink?

39:23.080 --> 39:25.120
It's wine with a venomous scorpion.
Too strong.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.200
Perfect.

39:28.080 --> 39:29.640
Keep her confined at the mansion

39:29.720 --> 39:31.360
until the Zhao delegation arrives.

39:34.600 --> 39:35.800
Wen Ji,

39:35.880 --> 39:37.080
take her to her room.

39:37.160 --> 39:38.240
Lu Ji,

39:38.320 --> 39:39.560
come with me to the liquor shop.

39:39.640 --> 39:41.840
- Yes.
- Isn't Lu Ji holding her?

39:41.920 --> 39:43.200
Let Lu Ji take her inside.

39:43.280 --> 39:46.280
Now that you're no longer poisoned,
you can continue watching over her.

39:47.280 --> 39:48.120
I…

39:54.400 --> 39:55.480
You…

39:57.120 --> 39:58.560
Don't.

40:10.720 --> 40:12.040
Let me out!

40:12.120 --> 40:12.960
Guards!

40:13.040 --> 40:14.240
Somebody!

40:14.320 --> 40:15.520
Am I not a person?

40:15.600 --> 40:16.680
Stay there.

40:16.760 --> 40:18.280
Before the Zhao delegation arrives,

40:18.360 --> 40:19.360
you're not going anywhere.

40:19.440 --> 40:20.360
How dare you?

40:20.440 --> 40:22.440
I have never been locked up
since I was a child.

40:23.000 --> 40:25.160
You'd better let me go now.

40:25.240 --> 40:26.960
Or else…

40:32.520 --> 40:33.600
Or else…

40:35.160 --> 40:36.400
Or else what?

40:38.320 --> 40:39.160
Wen Ji,

40:39.240 --> 40:40.160
what do you want?

40:44.240 --> 40:46.680
I've already prepared myself.

40:46.760 --> 40:48.200
Don't think you can poison me again.

40:48.280 --> 40:49.640
Anyway,

40:49.720 --> 40:52.680
you're not stepping out
of the Duke Mansion today.

40:53.400 --> 40:55.720
Wen Ji, how dare you?

40:56.360 --> 40:57.200
Just stay put.

40:57.280 --> 40:58.280
Don't think about leaving.

41:01.760 --> 41:03.040
I need to go to Ye Residence.

41:04.080 --> 41:06.400
Didn't Xiao Heng ask me
to treat Magistrate Xue?

41:06.960 --> 41:08.960
I'm going to treat him. I want to go now.

41:09.720 --> 41:11.160
Do you think I'll fall for that?

41:13.880 --> 41:15.720
You'd better get this straight.

41:16.680 --> 41:19.760
Xiao Heng even went spider hunting with me

41:19.840 --> 41:22.200
to make me treat Magistrate Xue.

41:22.840 --> 41:24.320
And you should know

41:24.400 --> 41:27.080
what Jiang Li means to him, right?

41:27.160 --> 41:30.440
If Magistrate Xue isn't treated in time,

41:31.000 --> 41:32.360
it'll be all your fault.

41:32.440 --> 41:33.880
Then

41:34.520 --> 41:37.920
you won't just get caned
a few times anymore.

41:51.280 --> 41:52.320
You are…

41:52.400 --> 41:54.120
I'm here to treat Magistrate Xue.

41:55.360 --> 41:56.360
You can't come in.

41:56.440 --> 41:58.440
This is trespassing.

41:58.520 --> 41:59.920
I can report you to the authorities.

42:00.000 --> 42:01.160
Vice Director Ye,

42:01.240 --> 42:02.560
we're here on Duke Su's orders

42:02.640 --> 42:03.800
to treat Magistrate Xue.

42:04.280 --> 42:05.640
Ms. Jiang Li also knows about this.

42:05.720 --> 42:07.280
Do you work for Duke Su?

42:07.840 --> 42:08.680
You know him, right?

42:08.760 --> 42:09.920
Can I go in now?

42:10.000 --> 42:11.120
No.

42:11.200 --> 42:13.120
Jiang Li didn't tell me about this.

42:13.200 --> 42:14.760
Let me inform her first.

42:14.840 --> 42:16.200
You don't need to bother with this.

42:18.160 --> 42:19.160
I get it now.

42:20.720 --> 42:22.040
He doesn't like Xiao Heng, right?

42:22.120 --> 42:23.320
Watch your words.

42:23.400 --> 42:24.680
Can you be more subtle?

42:24.760 --> 42:27.440
His lordship
just doesn't want to stoop to his level.

42:27.520 --> 42:28.360
Guys,

42:28.840 --> 42:29.800
please watch your words.

42:29.880 --> 42:32.040
Stop beating around the bush.

42:32.120 --> 42:34.920
- Are you letting me in or not?
- No.

42:35.000 --> 42:36.200
No?

42:36.280 --> 42:37.320
Ye Shijie, don't provoke her.

42:37.400 --> 42:38.760
She will--

42:46.640 --> 42:48.120
Keep an eye on him.

42:48.200 --> 42:49.720
I'm going in to do the treatment.

42:51.840 --> 42:52.920
Stop right there!

42:53.000 --> 42:54.960
It's wise to listen.

43:02.600 --> 43:03.600
You…

43:03.680 --> 43:04.920
You…

43:07.160 --> 43:08.120
Don't touch him!

43:12.120 --> 43:12.960
You're welcome.

43:15.200 --> 43:16.200
His illness

43:16.760 --> 43:17.720
is tricky to cure.

43:17.800 --> 43:18.760
Wait.

43:18.840 --> 43:20.040
Where did this quack come from?

43:20.120 --> 43:21.960
Who gave you the permission
to touch Magistrate Xue?

43:36.000 --> 43:37.400
Where am I?

43:38.280 --> 43:39.720
I'm the only one
who can treat his illness.

43:39.800 --> 43:42.160
But it can't be cured in one day.

43:42.240 --> 43:43.200
If the poison--

43:45.920 --> 43:47.280
If the treatment is too strong,

43:47.360 --> 43:48.720
it could be fatal.

43:48.800 --> 43:51.000
So I will come once a day from now on.

43:51.080 --> 43:52.800
If you have any questions,

43:52.880 --> 43:54.440
you can just ask Jiang Li.

43:55.280 --> 43:56.120
Wen Ji,

43:56.200 --> 43:57.440
take him outside.

43:58.120 --> 44:00.800
The next treatment is highly toxic,
so you'd better stay away.

44:00.880 --> 44:01.840
I'm not leaving.

44:03.880 --> 44:05.400
Do you think
you don't look pathetic enough?

44:14.280 --> 44:16.120
Give me the antidote!
I can walk myself out!

44:23.600 --> 44:25.280
Can you give me the antidote first?

44:26.240 --> 44:27.440
What's the rush?

44:27.520 --> 44:29.200
She'll give it to you when she's done.

44:42.880 --> 44:43.800
Wen Ji!

44:45.800 --> 44:46.720
Give me the antidote!

45:15.200 --> 45:16.040
Find Xiao Heng.

45:24.680 --> 45:25.960
Catch it.

45:41.400 --> 45:42.760
Don't just stand there! Find his lordship!

45:42.840 --> 45:44.000
The antidote.

45:47.960 --> 45:48.880
Open your mouth!

45:53.960 --> 45:55.240
His lordship is at the wine shop.

46:26.960 --> 46:28.640
Just surrender now.

46:28.720 --> 46:30.440
You're no match for me.

46:31.800 --> 46:34.720
Do you think you can last
until Xiao Heng gets here?

46:34.800 --> 46:35.760
Him?

46:36.640 --> 46:38.000
He's no match for me…

46:41.520 --> 46:42.640
We can only take our chances.

46:42.720 --> 46:43.560
What are you planning to do?

46:56.920 --> 47:00.000
That seems to be effective.

47:03.680 --> 47:04.640
But why do I feel

47:05.280 --> 47:07.200
that I'm also…
